# Set the region shape and sweep direction in one call.
#
# Deliberately one atomic request rather than two parameter writes followed by
# a replan: the panel would otherwise leave the planner half-configured if it
# died between the two, and a second client could interleave.
#
# An empty field means "leave this one alone", so a panel that only changes the
# sweep direction does not have to restate the shape it believes is current and
# risk overwriting a change someone else just made.

string region_type
string sweep_direction
---
bool success
string message

# The configuration in force after the call, accepted or not, so the caller can
# resynchronise its display without waiting for the latched topic.
CoverageConfig config
